WEBVTT

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:15.200
<b><i>Planet With</i></b>

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:36.240
<b>Episode 2:  Nebula Soldiers</b>

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:34.860
Looks like they took out Torai.

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:36.240
Hey, be quiet.

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:39.950
But he was the weakest of the seven of us.

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:41.700
Miu-chan...

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:45.790
Torai-san's measured values 
were the highest of all of us.

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:50.290
So, what, they took out the 
strongest one of us first?

00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:54.670
But all of you were within 
8% of each other's values.

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:55.630
Stop it, everyone.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.690
Torai-kun is right here.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:01:59.870
Don't worry about me.

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:01.680
I'm useless now.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:04.950
I've finished my report, so I'll be going.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:06.030
Wait, wait...

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:07.640
You're not fired or anything.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:11.380
I want you to take the lead in investigating
 the enemy mentioned in your report.

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:14.130
They may be lurking in that town.

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:15.820
Yes, sir.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:23.730
U-Um, Torai-san, what was the e-enemy like?

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:27.710
My memories are hazy,
 and I can't really remember.

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:32.170
There was a young boy... I think.

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:35.340
And a girl.

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:36.960
And then one more...

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:38.670
But I don't know.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:42.300
It feels like everyone had a cat face.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.140
What does that mean?

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:46.360
Some kind of technology disrupted 
your ability to recognize them.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:49.170
They ambushed you right after 
our battle with the massive weapon.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.730
The enemy is being very careful.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.320
For now, we need to discuss 
what to call these invaders.

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:57.410
We've decided to name the massive weapons 
that appeared in the sea "Nebula Weapons,"

00:02:57.410 --> 00:03:00.530
after our enemy, the invading force "Nebula."

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:00.530
<b>Massive Seaborne Floating Object
Nebula Weapon</b>

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.200
And the enemy that attacked Torai-kun,

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.410
<b>Unidentified Enemy Group
Nebula Soldiers</b>

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:04.410
we'll call "Nebula Soldiers."

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:08.180
We, the bearers of the Psychokinetic 
Mega-God Photon Armor,

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.660
are the only ones who can protect 
the Earth from Nebula's invasion.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:13.170
<b>Citizens' Safety Center</b>

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:16.270
The Citizens' Safety Center Special 
Defense Section: "Grand Paladin."

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.670
<b>Citizens' Safety Center
Special Defense Section</b>

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:17.420
<b>Citizens' Safety Center
Special Defense Section
Grand Paladin</b>

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:20.380
We can't afford to lose this power.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:23.450
So, as a way to stop this 
from happening in the future,

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:26.600
why don't we have everyone stay in pairs?

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:31.030
Pairing up will make it easier to 
handle the Nebula Soldiers, I believe.

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:31.600
Yes.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:34.260
I pick Haru-chan, then!

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.730
Okay, Miu-chan!

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.690
Benika, let's pair up.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.650
Don't slow me down, Yosuke.

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.290
I guess I'll take Nezuya-kun, then.

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:44.810
Glad to be working with you.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:45.890
Yeah.

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:47.580
Me, too.

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:49.540
You are dismissed, then.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.250
<b>Special Defense Section</b>

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.250
<b>Regular Report Conference</b>

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:53.970
Benika, how about we get lunch?

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:56.070
Sure, if you're paying.

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:57.560
Haru-chan, Nezuya-kun,

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:58.800
want to go to the arcade?

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.120
I've got a concert.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:02.830
You're in a band, huh?

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.500
No, I'm going to see one.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.350
Miu-chan, at least go to
 your afternoon classes.

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:15.730
Takashi, lend me some money.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.540
What happened to the 30,000 
yen I gave you yesterday, Dad?

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:19.970
Already spent it.

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:21.500
At the usual spot.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.540
You spent 30,000 yen at a steakhouse?

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:24.570
You'll die, you old geezer!

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:29.890
B-But meat is the only thing 
I have left to enjoy in life!

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:33.580
Don't take away the only 
thing an old man has!

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.620
Shut up. Go.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.070
Shiraishi-kun, deal with this.

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:37.760
Of course.

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.370
Takezo-san...

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.040
Shiraishi-chan...

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:50.680
Takezo-san, it's time to go home.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:53.450
Want to go get a drink, Shiraishi-chan?

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:57.020
I don't drink, I'm afraid.

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:00.400
Nebula...

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:05.360
We will stop your invasion. I swear it.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:10.450
I will be humanity's leader.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:11.960
Aw, come on!

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:14.780
Aw, I said no, Takezo-san.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:15.910
Would you knock it the fu—

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:26.260
What is this?

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.310
Tonkatsu.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:28.720
It's not meat.

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:33.000
It's special vegetarian tonkatsu, 
made from soybeans and wheat bran.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.520
Just give me the real thing!

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:36.410
If you don't want it, I'll take it.

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:37.920
Fine, I'll eat it.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.650
Why vegetarian tonkatsu?

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:52.740
<b>What Is This Mysterious, 
Massive Floating Object?</b>

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:43.420
<i>This is the massive floating 
object we saw yesterday.</i>

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:47.360
<i>The size and design make me question 
the sanity of the man who made it.</i>

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.600
<i>Some people think it might be a weapon 
belonging to a certain country.</i>

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.740
<i>I said "the man who made it,"</i>

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.040
<i>but I can't imagine any 
human being making such a thing.</i>

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:59.160
<i>Some rumors say it's a super-weapon 
belonging to an ancient civilization,</i>

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:01.630
<i>or aliens, or mole people...</i>

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:00.830
Did you guys make that?

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:01.630
Nope.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:06.010
<b>Friend or Foe!?
Who Are Those Mysterious 7?</b>

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:06.010
<i>These seven mysterious people are believed 
to have destroyed the massive object.</i>

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:08.200
<i>Who are they?</i>

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.470
<i>The internet is abuzz with theories.</i>

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:14.530
"By the way, Soya, are you 
not going to school today?"

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:16.880
That's what Sensei says.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:18.960
I don't care about school.

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:21.510
It doesn't matter. This isn't my world.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:25.940
"It does matter," Sensei says.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:28.530
Are you in a position to lecture people?

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.490
You're the ones who brought me here!

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:32.280
To make me into a soldier!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:33.930
Stop it.

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:36.640
If it weren't for Sensei, you'd be...

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:43.920
If you say so, Sensei.

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:48.080
You're not going to tell me what he said?

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:48.880
Hmph!

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:51.860
<i>Our next story is about an old 
man who appears at steakhouses</i>

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:56.100
<b>Speed-Eating
Old Man Appears</b>

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:53.650
<i>in town and eats them out of business!</i>

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:56.100
<i>He puts professional speed-eaters to shame.</i>

00:06:56.340 --> 00:07:00.440
Anyway, I need your power 
so I can get my revenge.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.810
So I'll be here for a while, Sensei.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:06.980
But I hate this thing, and I hate you, too!

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:08.340
I'm never going to forgive you!

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:14.010
What?

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:16.150
My room is right there.

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:22.830
Soya-kun, aren't you going 
to thank me for the food?

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:25.590
Aren't you?

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:27.340
Thank you for the food.

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:44.940
I'm going for a run.

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:52.360
What are these?!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.410
Iron clogs?!

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.290
<i>Does Kuroi-kun have a cold?</i>

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:08.610
So heavy...

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:10.690
So hard to run...

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.560
I need more stamina.

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:22.950
<i>There are still six enemies left.</i>

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:26.440
<i>And just defeating them 
won't bring an end to this.</i>

00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:31.220
Damn it...

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:32.670
Everybody...

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:36.390
I'll avenge you... I promise!

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:05.230
<i>He's my enemy!</i>

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:07.560
<i>I stole his bottle, though.</i>

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:09.110
<i>And that's...</i>

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:13.070
<i>A meat bun!</i>

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.710
Can I ask you something?

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:25.120
Wh-What?

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:27.750
Are you in middle school? Shouldn't you be in class?

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.850
I'm in high school.

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:34.300
But I'm skipping.

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:37.550
Cutting class, huh?

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:47.190
Want one?

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:49.670
Yeah!

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:53.530
Thank you!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:07.250
Hey, did you see a kid about your 
size last night, wearing a mask?

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:12.650
N-No...

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.130
Well, you wouldn't have, I guess.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:17.840
Who runs around in a mask, anyway?

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:20.900
<i>He's looking for me?</i>

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:25.960
Hey.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.030
Is school not fun?

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:30.760
Sorry.

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:33.860
I actually just saw you 
crying from a ways off.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.570
It's none of your business.

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:37.950
True.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.490
Sorry.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:43.200
Bye. Cool clogs, by the way.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:44.590
Good luck.

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:56.280
Okay, this time I'll get my bun.

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.470
Let's eat—

00:10:58.920 --> 00:10:59.700
Hey!

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:01.460
Get out of here, now!

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:02.810
Get to the evacuation area!

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.020
I guess you couldn't in those iron clogs.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:06.810
You can borrow these!

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:09.230
Bye! Get out of here!

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:10.350
Ow!

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:19.280
<i>A message from the Citizens' Safety Center.</i>

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:24.920
<i>A massive unidentified flying 
object just appeared.</i>

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:28.800
<i>Citizens are requested to please evacuate.</i>

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:29.910
<i>I repeat...</i>

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:34.130
<i>Citizens are requested to please evacuate.</i>

00:11:34.740 --> 00:11:39.010
More massive flying objects have 
appeared all over the world!

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:41.880
Will those mysterious 
seven people appear again?

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.630
That's them! The mysterious—

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:46.850
Huh? This time, there are only six.

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.020
One is missing.

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:49.980
Ready?

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.640
Let's go, everyone!

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:53.680
There you are!

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:56.360
Okay, time to do this!

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:11.560
It's bean jam?!

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:22.880
Everyone, split up and find its weak spot.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.910
Why are you taking the lead?

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.550
Because everybody but 
me is a closet pervert.

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:29.770
Does that include me?

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:30.310
Yup.

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:33.940
We could have Shiraishi-chan lead us, right?

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:37.150
But we need someone out here 
with us who can give orders.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:40.230
I'll follow Miu-chan.

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.640
<i>Okay, everyone.</i>

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:46.590
<i>Just like last time,
 when you find a way inside,</i>

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:48.490
<i>head in, and destroy the core.</i>

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.560
Roger!

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:54.650
They're homing?!

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:57.090
<i>Just like Torai-san's report said,</i>

00:12:57.090 --> 00:13:00.630
<i>watch out for the illusions the enemy 
shows you once you're inside the core.</i>

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:10.310
If that big creepy thing 
isn't yours, then whose is it?

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.540
Did you just call it creepy?

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:13.060
I did.

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:15.010
But it's so cute.

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:19.200
That belongs to the Sealing Faction.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.360
We're the Pacifist Faction.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:26.530
We're both part of Nebula, 
just different factions.

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:28.990
That's what Sensei says.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.670
Nebula is your organization?

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:36.330
Nebula is concerned about human evolution.

00:13:37.890 --> 00:13:38.880
I found it!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.340
This is Miu Inaba! I'm heading inside!

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.170
Miu-chan, be careful!

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:45.710
Don't worry! Leave it to me!

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.300
I'm strong. I'm strong. I'm strong.

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:53.220
I'm strong!

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.520
I'm strong!

00:13:55.340 --> 00:14:00.310
Now that humanity has begun 
to evolve the power to fight,

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.170
the Sealing Faction's goal 
is to seal humanity on Earth

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:04.280
to prevent them from evolving further.

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:08.610
We Pacifists, however, wish to keep 
our intervention to a minimum,

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:12.870
confiscate that power, 
and resume observing humanity.

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:15.190
Calm down, Miu.

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:18.540
I'm strong!

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:20.750
I have power!

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:22.870
Our hope is that humanity

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:26.630
will chose the evolution of love 
over the evolution of power.

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:29.330
I don't really get it,

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:32.470
but that big thing isn't 
really on our side, then?

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:39.710
So this is the core?

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:42.580
I was supposed to see some 
kind of illusion, I thought.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:47.320
Bow!

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:50.850
Haru-chan?

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:01.670
Begin!

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:22.960
Winner!

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:43.330
I always wanted to be big 
and strong like you, Haru-chan.

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:45.380
I wanted power.

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:49.060
Now you're stronger than me, Miu-chan.

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.340
Congratulations on your victory.

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:02.520
But...

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.410
This is an illusion.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:12.570
I have power in the real world!

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.300
Psychokinetic Mega-God Photon Armor!

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:27.800
Don't think you can control people's 
hearts with a lie like this, Nebula!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:31.800
<b>"It's okay to be weak."</b>

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:54.110
Miu-chan! Miu-chan, are you okay?

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.170
Of course I am!

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:14.380
<i>Inaba-san, well done.</i>

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:16.750
I'm so tired.

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:17.620
Me, too.

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:22.350
<i>Now, everyone, head home in 
pairs like we discussed.</i>

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:25.850
Let's go, Miu-chan.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:29.480
It was amazing how you beat something so big!

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:34.400
Thank you, Haru-chan!

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:40.970
<i>The massive flying object has disappeared!</i>

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:43.370
<i>Is it an enemy of humanity?</i>

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:47.120
<i>Are the mysterious six 
heroes protecting humanity?</i>

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:49.080
Ow...

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:51.060
You okay?

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.690
A little tired, that's all.

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:55.260
Want to lean on me?

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:56.050
I'm fine.

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:58.510
Let's walk side-by-side.

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:01.350
I'm happy right now.

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.810
I want to brag to everyone.

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:08.810
"I saved the Earth together with Haru-chan!"

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:12.020
I'm worried.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.990
I don't want you to be in danger.

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:22.370
Give me the source of your power.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:27.520
A boy in a mask?

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:29.710
Is that the one who attacked Torai-san?

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:31.540
Haru-chan, let's fight!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.300
Together, we're invincible!

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:36.760
R-Right, Miu-chan!

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:38.550
That makes this easy.

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:40.480
Even if it's two against one,
 I'll beat you both!

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:41.440
Sensei!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.150
Let's go, invader!

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:58.400
Psychic... Spiral...

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:00.740
Break!

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:10.170
Got him!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.220
Crap!

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.260
What's going on?

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:24.910
Sensei says that's a judo throw
 called an "uchi mata!"

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:26.940
But are you okay, Sensei?

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:28.020
You're mine!

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.690
Spiral Break!

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:46.200
Did you see that?

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.970
We're the strongest pair in the world,

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:50.120
and we won't lose to you invaders.

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:52.460
Ow...

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.180
Invaders?

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:58.170
They seem to think all 
of Nebula are invaders.

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:00.360
This is it!

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:02.250
Time to avenge Torai-san!

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:04.470
He's still alive, though.

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:06.110
Can we do this, Sensei?

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:07.950
Okay...

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:10.380
Come on!

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:11.640
Counter...

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:12.750
Here I go!

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.650
This is my last strike!

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:18.780
Psychic Spiral Break!

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:22.450
Giga-Cat Upper!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:26.870
Perfect timing!

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:39.900
No way...

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:41.340
Miu-chan!

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:13.780
We beat her.

00:21:13.780 --> 00:21:15.190
That's two!

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:18.690
No more for today.

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:20.250
It's too risky to fight anymore.

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:22.720
That's what Sensei says.

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:24.010
No, I'm not done yet!

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:25.720
There's one more...

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:28.330
Miu-chan! Miu-chan!

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:29.050
Are you okay?

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:30.610
Come in!

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:31.770
Miu-chan!

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:33.510
No...

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:36.850
My... My power!

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.710
They're just standing there!

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:39.420
If we attack now...

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:40.190
Soya-kun!

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:56.280
I'm surrounded!

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:00.280
Checkmate.

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:06.980
Don't mess with humanity.

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:09.970
<b><i>To Be Continued</i></b>

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:45.270
<b><i>Next Time
Avenger 1</i></b>

00:23:42.970 --> 00:23:45.070
"Avenger 1."
